.TH FBVIEW 1 "June 14, 2026"
.SH NAME
fbview \- display a JPEG image on the N64 framebuffer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B fbview
.I image.jpg
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B fbview
loads a JPEG image, scales it to fit the current
.IR /dev/fb0
mode while preserving aspect ratio, clears the framebuffer, and draws the image
as 16-bit RGBA5551 pixels.
.PP
The current framebuffer mode can be selected with
.BR fbset (1).
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /dev/fb0
N64 framebuffer device.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fbset (1)
